            oa:hasSelector [ a oa:TextQuoteSelector ;
                oa:exact "I would expect it to be multi-tiered, right? An actor hub wouldn't include everything that that actor said. The actor hub would include a link to all of the calls that they were in, all of the narratives, and all of the positions, right? It is one level down, and you'd see the frame." ;
