            oa:hasSelector [ a oa:TextQuoteSelector ;
                oa:exact "If you list the call with its IRI, then you would list all of the positions underneath it as frames with no IRI, right? It can just expand the call. The same with narrative: you list the narratives with IRI, and then everything underneath it as just frames." ;
